[2025-11-20 16:48:31][DEBUG] Intervention trouvée: {"id":130,"reference":"#VS3625-2907","title":"soucis de distribution video","description":"les images entrant dans la grille virtuelle ne sont pas bien ou pas du tout retransmise au projecteur et \u00e9crans de retours. l'image de la camera 1 saute entre le fond *VDSC, l'image et image au noir.\r\nla cam 2 affiche uniquement le fond VDSC. Cyrille a reboot\u00e9 la baie et les encodeurs avant de m'appeler\r\nr\u00e9solution en rebootant le processeur extron.\r\n\r\na noter que la veille Cyrillito a appeler pour signaler que des gens avaient essay\u00e9 de forcer le meuble micro et d\u00e9placer celui ci, ce qui a fait tomber certains micros et boug\u00e9 les bases de charge.","demande_par":"Cyrille Galas","client_id":36,"site_id":69,"room_id":176,"contract_id":178,"project_id":null,"type_id":7,"status_id":4,"priority_id":4,"duration":"0.50","date_planif":"2025-10-08","heure_planif":"10:25:00","technician_id":3,"parent_id":null,"tickets_used":2,"intervention_form_path":null,"created_at":"2025-10-08 10:00:00","updated_at":"2025-10-09 15:52:58","closed_at":"2025-10-08 10:41:54","ref_client":"","contact_client":"Cyrille.Galas@caissedesdepots.fr","client_name":"CAISSE DES DEPOTS ","site_name":"ICDC BAGNEUX","room_name":"RDC Atrium","technician_first_name":"Reynald","technician_last_name":"Mercier","status_name":"R\u00e9solu","status_color":"#fda557","type_name":"Support t\u00e9l\u00e9phonique","type_requires_travel":0,"priority_name":"Urgente","priority_color":"#fe786c","contract_name":"ICDC Bagneux"} 
