[2026-02-13 15:24:21][DEBUG] Intervention trouvée: {"id":160,"reference":"#VS525-9175","title":"Dysfonctionnements r\u00e9currents des encodeurs\/d\u00e9codeurs AMX NMX-ENC\/DEC-N1122A - INC0926982 ","description":"Sympt\u00f4mes constat\u00e9s\r\n\u2022\tC\u00f4t\u00e9 d\u00e9codeurs :\r\nLe bug appara\u00eet lors du basculement d\u2019affichage entre le desktop et le laptop. L\u2019image reste fig\u00e9e sur une source pour un ou plusieurs d\u00e9codeurs (TV ou vid\u00e9oprojecteurs). Un red\u00e9marrage du d\u00e9codeur permet de r\u00e9tablir la situation. Ce cas reste toutefois rare (observ\u00e9 deux ou trois fois).\r\n\u2022\tC\u00f4t\u00e9 encodeurs (plus pr\u00e9occupant) :\r\nLes encodeurs laptop pr\u00e9sentent de fa\u00e7ons al\u00e9atoires mais r\u00e9currentes une absence d\u2019audio (et parfois m\u00eame d\u2019affichage) lors de la diffusion depuis un appareil externe (Mac, Windows, Surface).\r\nLe red\u00e9marrage du bo\u00eetier permet temporairement de corriger le probl\u00e8me.\r\nCe dysfonctionnement commence \u00e0 impacter des professeurs VIP, ce qui devient particuli\u00e8rement pr\u00e9occupant.","demande_par":null,"client_id":5,"site_id":8,"room_id":6,"contract_id":168,"project_id":null,"type_id":8,"status_id":1,"priority_id":4,"duration":"0.00","date_planif":null,"heure_planif":null,"technician_id":5,"parent_id":null,"tickets_used":null,"intervention_form_path":null,"created_at":"2025-10-23 11:28:00","updated_at":"2025-10-23 11:32:18","closed_at":null,"ref_client":null,"contact_client":"olivier.saintillan@insead.edu","type_requires_travel":0,"client_name":"INSEAD","site_name":"Fontainebleau","room_name":"Amphi CEA","technician_first_name":"Zakaria","technician_last_name":"Amraoui","status_name":"Nouveau","status_color":"#53b198","type_name":"Support \u00e0 distance","priority_name":"Urgente","priority_color":"#fe786c","contract_name":"CC 2024 new"} 
