[2026-02-13 15:25:05][DEBUG] Intervention trouvée: {"id":71,"reference":"#VS525-0924","title":"Probl\u00e8me d\u2019affichage Mac en Amphi Dean Berry","description":"Le client rencontre un dysfonctionnement d'affichage avec un ordinateur Mac connect\u00e9 au syst\u00e8me de projection de l\u2019amphith\u00e9\u00e2tre Dean Berry. L\u2019image appara\u00eet bri\u00e8vement avant de dispara\u00eetre, emp\u00eachant l\u2019utilisation normale du syst\u00e8me. Une incompatibilit\u00e9 HDCP est suspect\u00e9e. Apr\u00e8s v\u00e9rification, le firmware de la matrice Crestron DM-MD8x8-RPS est \u00e0 jour (v. 4.102.352400074). Le param\u00e8tre \"HDCP Support\" de l\u2019entr\u00e9e Laptop \u00e9tait sur \"HDCP_Off_Support\" et a \u00e9t\u00e9 remis sur \"HDCP_Auto_Support\".\r\n","demande_par":"Vincent DE MARCHI","client_id":5,"site_id":8,"room_id":47,"contract_id":168,"project_id":null,"type_id":8,"status_id":2,"priority_id":3,"duration":"1.50","date_planif":"2025-09-08","heure_planif":"17:00:00","technician_id":5,"parent_id":null,"tickets_used":3,"intervention_form_path":null,"created_at":"2025-09-08 17:00:00","updated_at":"2025-09-25 15:06:11","closed_at":"2025-09-09 10:57:12","ref_client":"INC0925629","contact_client":"onsite.supportfbl@insead.edu","type_requires_travel":0,"client_name":"INSEAD","site_name":"Fontainebleau","room_name":"Amphi Dean Berry","technician_first_name":"Zakaria","technician_last_name":"Amraoui","status_name":"En cours","status_color":"#83b64a","type_name":"Support \u00e0 distance","priority_name":"Haute","priority_color":"#fda557","contract_name":"CC 2024 new"} 
