[2026-02-27 18:48:28][DEBUG] SQL Update Intervention: UPDATE interventions SET title = :title, client_id = :client_id, site_id = :site_id, room_id = :room_id, technician_id = :technician_id, status_id = :status_id, priority_id = :priority_id, type_id = :type_id, duration = :duration, description = :description, demande_par = :demande_par, type_requires_travel = :type_requires_travel, contract_id = :contract_id, date_planif = :date_planif, heure_planif = :heure_planif, created_at = :created_at, ref_client = :ref_client, contact_client = :contact_client WHERE id = :id {"params":{":title":"Disfonctionnement Cam 2 et 4",":client_id":"36",":site_id":"60",":room_id":"173",":technician_id":"9",":status_id":"1",":priority_id":"2",":type_id":"8",":duration":"0.25",":description":"Nous rencontrons un dysfonctionnement avec les cam\u00e9ras 2 et 4 de la salle. Celles-ci sont bien connect\u00e9es, je ping bien les 4 cam\u00e9ras, et je peux me connecter sur les 4 \u00e0 distance au travers de notre serveur de rebond. Bien que les cam\u00e9ras 1 et 3 renvoient l\u2019image de la salle, les cam\u00e9ras 2 et 4 quant \u00e0 elles renvoient une image noire. Comme rencontr\u00e9 pr\u00e9c\u00e9demment dans nos autres salles, et particuli\u00e8rement la salle du conseil de Bordeaux lors de la mise \u00e0 jour avec Inogeni, on renvoie une image noire mais par moment pendant des fractions de secondes, l\u2019image s\u2019affiche puis disparait \u00e0 nouveau.\r\n\r\nJe vous mets ci-dessous un exemple en vue side by side des cam\u00e9ras 1 et 2 (1 OK, 2 KO)\r\n",":demande_par":"Galas",":type_requires_travel":0,":contract_id":"194",":date_planif":"2026-03-02",":heure_planif":"10:30:00",":created_at":"2026-02-27 18:43:00",":ref_client":"",":contact_client":"cyril.lebraud@caissedesdepots.fr",":id":"264"},"updates":["title = :title","client_id = :client_id","site_id = :site_id","room_id = :room_id","technician_id = :technician_id","status_id = :status_id","priority_id = :priority_id","type_id = :type_id","duration = :duration","description = :description","demande_par = :demande_par","type_requires_travel = :type_requires_travel","contract_id = :contract_id","date_planif = :date_planif","heure_planif = :heure_planif","created_at = :created_at","ref_client = :ref_client","contact_client = :contact_client"]}
