[2026-03-06 12:23:11][DEBUG] SQL Update Intervention: UPDATE interventions SET title = :title, client_id = :client_id, site_id = :site_id, room_id = :room_id, technician_id = :technician_id, status_id = :status_id, priority_id = :priority_id, type_id = :type_id, duration = :duration, description = :description, demande_par = :demande_par, type_requires_travel = :type_requires_travel, contract_id = :contract_id, date_planif = :date_planif, heure_planif = :heure_planif, created_at = :created_at, ref_client = :ref_client, contact_client = :contact_client WHERE id = :id {"params":{":title":"Probl\u00e8me cam\u00e9ra GBureau",":client_id":"36",":site_id":"58",":room_id":"171",":technician_id":"7",":status_id":"1",":priority_id":"2",":type_id":"8",":duration":"0.25",":description":"Nos coll\u00e8gues de la r\u00e9gie nous ont alert\u00e9 en indiquant que lorsqu\u2019une visio \u00e9tait lanc\u00e9e, il ne pouvait plus basculer\/changer de cam\u00e9ra, ni m\u00eame agir sur la cam\u00e9ra s\u00e9lectionn\u00e9e (d\u00e9placement droite\/gauche, zoom,\u2026)\r\n\r\nEn testant ce jour, je m\u2019aper\u00e7ois que les r\u00e9glages sont possibles mais avec une logique invers\u00e9e ; le mode \u00ab Full \u00bb laisse apparaitre qu\u2019on s\u00e9lectionne la cam\u00e9ra que l\u2019on souhaite afficher dans \u00ab Choix cam\u00e9ra cadrage principal P \u00bb, et l\u00e0, que je bascule d\u2019une cam\u00e9ra \u00e0 l\u2019autre, je reste toujours sur la m\u00eame cam\u00e9ra\u2026en revanche je peux bien basculer d\u2019une cam\u00e9ra \u00e0 l\u2019autre dans la partie \u00ab Choix cam\u00e9ra cadrage secondaire S \u00bb. Ce ph\u00e9nom\u00e8ne est r\u00e9cent, et \u00e0 titre d\u2019info nous vous avons remont\u00e9 un dysfonctionnement similaire il y a qq temps dans la salle Atrium \u00e0 Bagneux. \r\n",":demande_par":"Galas",":type_requires_travel":0,":contract_id":"121",":date_planif":"2026-03-02",":heure_planif":"10:00:00",":created_at":"2026-02-27 18:37:00",":ref_client":"",":contact_client":"cyril.lebraud@caissedesdepots.fr",":id":"263"},"updates":["title = :title","client_id = :client_id","site_id = :site_id","room_id = :room_id","technician_id = :technician_id","status_id = :status_id","priority_id = :priority_id","type_id = :type_id","duration = :duration","description = :description","demande_par = :demande_par","type_requires_travel = :type_requires_travel","contract_id = :contract_id","date_planif = :date_planif","heure_planif = :heure_planif","created_at = :created_at","ref_client = :ref_client","contact_client = :contact_client"]}
